				<r3d:remarks>The National Earthquake DataBase contains all Canadian earthquake locations and derived parameters since the 1600&#039;s .  
The National WaveForm Archive (https://www.earthquakescanada.nrcan.gc.ca/stndon/NWFA-ANFO/index-en.php) contains digital waveform data acquired since 1975.
The National Earthquake Database (NEDB) comprises a number of separate databases.</r3d:remarks>
